--- !u!114 &61734914
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 61734912}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d907d2c93c0298d46b3d5e1162a93ab1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  textComponent: {fileID: 876232067}
  player: {fileID: 1868031129}
  lines:
  - Ahh... Hello little Mori; I am relieved to see that you've made it - I do hope
    you are prepared for your first day.
  - You have been brought to the final stage; a place with souls waiting in the wing
    - their bodies prepared for their final act... but you must aid the mind.
  - Take your Atropos Shears and find those who remain... hanging on by a thread.
  - Be warned; to release the binds of those tethered to the mortal plane, you must
    explore a most cherished memory... find a memento; a sentimental item.
  - Use the words of the ascending to guide your selection. And Mori... choose wisely.
    I'll be watching.
  - Best of luck; remember - we all must die.
  textSpeed: 0.02
